    clampMax: true
    normMin: 1.0
    normMax: 65535.0
    value: 9981
  - name: Configfile
    style: File
    label: Config File
    value: config.py
  - name: Identifier
    style: Str
    value: example2
  - name: Tdcoredir
    style: Folder
    label: TD Core Dir
    startSection: true
    default: C:/Users/croni/Projects/Sites/td-web-gui/packages/td-core/touchdesigner
    help: Absolute path to packages/td-core/touchdesigner on this machine's checkout. The webserver-callbacks / webrtc-callbacks / parameter-execute DATs sync against files inside this folder -- set it once per machine so those file params don't depend on how many folders deep this .toe happens to live relative to the package.
parameters:
